gned}f'(x)&=\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(1\\cdot {4}^{x}+1\\cdot {6}^{x}-4x^2+2) \\\\ &=1\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({4}^{x})+1\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({6}^{x})-4\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(x^2)+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2) \\\\ &=1({4}^{x}\\ln(4))+1({6}^{x}\\ln(6))-4(2x)+0 \\\\ &=1\\ln(4)\\cdot {4}^{x}+1\\ln(6)\\cdot {6}^{x}-8x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the instantaneous rate of change at $x=1$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f'(1)&=1\\ln(4)\\cdot {4}^{(1)}+1\\ln(6)\\cdot {6}^{(1)}-8(1) \\\\ &=1(4)\\ln(4)+1(6)\\ln(6)-(8)(1) \\\\ &=-8 + 4 \\ln{\\left(4 \\right)} + 6 \\ln{\\left(6 \\right)}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535208 17592186045443 true] [17592186479957 1080 "-8 + 4 \\ln{\\left(4 \\right)} + 6 \\ln{\\left(6 \\right)}" 13194139535208 17592186045443 true] [17592186479957 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535208 17592186045443 true] [17592186479957 1083 #uuid "4aeb0bf4-6520-54f3-84ca-e7dbe38f5e64" 13194139535208 17592186045443 true] [17592186479958 1080 "\\frac{\\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}}{3} + \\frac{\\ln{\\left(6 \\right)}}{3} + 6" 13194139535208 17592186045443 true] [17592186479958 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535208 17592186045443 true] [17592186479958 1083 #uuid "4b6645ee-3c3d-53ef-9146-60dda2be4d17" 13194139535208 17592186045443 true] [17592186479959 1080 "f^{′}(x) = 5 \\cdot 6^{x}" 13194139535208 17592186045443 true] [17592186479959 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535208 17592186045443 true] [17592186479959 1083 #uuid "4c07586b-bfcb-537a-b1fb-2b79dc2f5e73" 13194139535208 17592186045443 true] [17592186479960 1068 #edb/ref 17592186479950 13194139535208 17592186045443 true] [17592186479960 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139535208 17592186045443 true] [17592186479960 1071 "Given that $f(x)={6}^{x}+5{e}^{x}$, find the instantaneous rate of change at $x=0.$" 13194139535208 17592186045443 true] [17592186479960 1072 #uuid "50148e2c-17f0-5238-804f-16d18ed920ad" 13194139535208 17592186045443 true] [17592186479960 1074 "Applying the for